\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Island</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Snowlands</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Gizmo's Observatory</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$323,420</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Flamethrower is a highly expensive item used commonly to get into caves or the <a href=\"/wiki/Aroura_Quest\" title=\"Aroura Quest\">Aurora Tools</a>. Players can easily make their money back after getting this item, as <a href=\"/wiki/Sapphire\" title=\"Sapphire\">Sapphire</a> Cave is highly profitable. Located in the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a> for $323,420.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Looks how you would commonly expect a flamethrower to look, when holding it, it glows slightly orange. This glow gets brighter when using the flamethrower.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Flamethrower was added on December 1st of 2024, along with the Christmas update.</li>\n<li>The Flamethrower is currently located in the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a></li>\n<li>The Flamethrower can be used to turn almost any tree into an <a href=\"/wiki/Ash_Tree\" title=\"Ash Tree\">Ash Tree</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ash_Tree\" title=\"Ash Tree\">Ash Trees</a> are unaffected)=</li>\n<li>The Flamethower may be a reference to the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.teamfortress.com/wiki/Flame_Thrower\">Flamethrower</a> from Team Fortress Two.</li>\n<li>alternative <a href=\"/wiki/Icethrower\" title=\"Icethrower\">icethrower</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901065229\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 75/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 68/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recur